  "_item": {
    "note": "Not part of the web map. An ArcGIS item's `extent` property is documented as decimal degrees (WGS84), while this map's own viewpoint is EPSG:3857 metres - two numbers in two units for two different properties. publish_to_portal.py reads the degrees from here for the item and the metres from initialState for the map.",
